cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use htpolynet in published work, please cite the SoftwareX article
  under `preferred-citation`, along with the GAFF and Gromacs papers listed
  in the documentation.
title: htpolynet
abstract: >-
  Automated molecular-dynamics system builder for amorphous network polymers.
  Generates atomistic models of cross-linked polymer networks, together with
  the Gromacs topology and parameter files needed to simulate them, from only
  the monomer structures, a description of the polymerization chemistry, and a
  handful of system-size and composition options. Atom typing and parameter
  generation use the General Amber Force Field.
